&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Atlas HXM is the global workforce platform built on compliance. We help companies determine how to engage each member of their workforce and then execute with accountability built in — direct Employer of Record (EOR), Agent of Record (AOR), payroll, and compliance capabilities backed by a decade of practitioner-led expertise. Recognized as a category Leader by NelsonHall and Everest Group, Atlas HXM builds Human Experience Management into everything we do, guided by our &quot;For People, by People&quot; principle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;The future of work is borderless, and so are we. Our people are located around the globe — in the U.S., the UK, India, Colombia, China, and beyond. Diversity and belonging are not just values; they are who we are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;We are also committed to making a positive impact. Through our Environment, Social, and Governance (ESG) impact initiative, we are addressing our environmental footprint and promoting social responsibility. Our impact program is central to our vision and culture, focusing on employee wellness, diversity, charitable work, and ethical corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Senior Regulatory Affairs &amp;amp; Entity Corporate Governance Manager will lead the company’s regulatory strategy, ensuring compliance with all relevant regulations. This senior role focuses on managing regulatory affairs for the organization and providing strategic guidance on governance matters to support our corporate entities globally. The Senior Regulatory Affairs &amp;amp; Entity Corporate Governance Manager&amp;nbsp;will work closely with legal, risk &amp;amp; compliance, and operational teams to implement a regulatory framework that meets both local and international requirements while fostering best practices in corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a 10-month fixed-term contract for an individual contributor.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a comprehensive regulatory strategy that aligns with the company&#39;s business objectives and supports its global operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and interpret global regulatory changes across jurisdictions and assess their potential impact on the company, ensuring that policies and procedures remain up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the organization is compliant with all applicable laws, regulations, and standards, including industry-specific regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to implement regulatory initiatives and ensure effective risk management practices are in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary liaison with regulatory authorities and lead regulatory filings, and inquiries to maintain a positive relationship with regulatory bodies worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entity Corporate Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue building and overseeing the corporate governance framework, adherence to best practices, Company Law requirements, and evolving regulations (e.g., Ultimate Beneficial Ownership (UBO) requirements) for all legal entities globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an accurate and up-to-date record of all corporate entities, including organizational structures, board and shareholder information, and registration and compliance with the corporate legal requirements for each jurisdiction.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team prepares, coordinates, and maintains the accuracy of corporate governance documents, including board meeting agendas, minutes, resolutions, and annual returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the company’s annual governance activities, ensuring the team accurately and timely prepares the board meeting minutes, corporate resolutions, and annual filings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support corporate initiatives related to entity management, including new entity formations, mergers, dissolutions, and reorganizations, ensuring adherence to regulatory and governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team submits of statutory filings, regulatory reports, and annual disclosures for all entities in a timely manner, overseeing ongoing corporate legal compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure efficient coordination with local in-country counsel and service providers to manage corporate changes and regulatory filings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management for Entity Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and assess regulatory and governance risks associated with the company’s operations, and develop strategies to mitigate those risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the risk management function to integrate governance and compliance risks into the broader enterprise risk management framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular risk assessments, corporate governance audits, and corporate legal compliance checks to identify gaps and recommend improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership and Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing global regulatory and corporate governance team, promoting a culture of corporate legal compliance and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with internal stakeholders, including Legal, Operations, HR, IT, and Finance, to support a cohesive approach to regulatory compliance and corporate governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic advisor to senior leadership on regulatory and corporate governance issues, including advising on new business initiatives, acquisitions, and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Law or Corporate Governance; alternatively, a degree in Business, Finance, or a related field &amp;nbsp;and a recognized corporate governance certification (e.g., CSQS, formerly ICSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 8+ years of experience in corporate governance, corporate legal compliance, global legal entity management preferably within a multinational or global organization with a high volume of subsidiaries across different regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in managing corporate legal compliance globally across multiple jurisdictions, particularly across EMEA, and an ability to navigate and differentiate between various legal systems, legal entity structures, local statutory filing obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrable expertise in managing regulatory affairs, particularly with a focus on licensing. Experience with the Employer of Record (EOR) model is highly beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of regulatory frameworks and corporate governance best practices, particularly across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of international entity management requirements and the ability to navigate multi-jurisdictional regulations, particularly across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and project management skills, with a focus on regulatory strategy and risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and negotiation skills, with the ability to influence at all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a proactive and strategic mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and projects in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory Expertise: Deep knowledge of global regulatory standards and best practices, with the ability to navigate complex regulatory environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Thinking: Ability to anticipate regulatory and governance trends, interpret complex regulations, and devise strategies to ensure entity compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrity and Confidentiality: Unwavering commitment to ethics, confidentiality, and handling sensitive information with discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Proven ability to work effectively across departments and with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: Comfortable working in a rapidly changing regulatory environment and responding swiftly to new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position description may not describe all duties, responsibilities, and skills associated with this position. It is intended to portray the major aspects of the job. Other duties or skills may be required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work with a purpose — simplifying global expansion across borders and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A diverse and inclusive environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Country-specific benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your birthday off and a day for you to volunteer and give back to the organization of your choice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Generous Parental Leave Program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Growth and development opportunities with access to a top learning content provider&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to challenge yourself in a high-performing organization and leave each day knowing you have made an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atlas Technology Solutions, Inc. (Atlas HXM) is an Equal Opportunity Employer and Prohibits Discrimination and Harassment of Any Kind: Atlas HXM is committed to the principle of equal employment opportunity for all employees and to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment. All employment decisions at Atlas HXM are based on business needs, job requirements and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religion or belief, national, social or ethnic origin, sex (including pregnancy), age, physical, mental or sensory disability, HIV status, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or expression, marital, civil union or domestic partnership status, past or present military service, family medical history or genetic information, family or parental status, or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we operate. Atlas HXM will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. Atlas HXM encourages applicants of all ages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atlas HXM will provide accommodation on request throughout the recruitment, selection and assessment process for applicants with disabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring decisions are based upon Atlas HXM’s operating needs, and applicant merit including, but not limited to, qualifications, experience, ability, availability, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be subject to a background check under local law after an employment offer has been made. Employment may be subject to results. In addition, references may be requested at the final stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a ----- HXM will only email candidates from an ----- email address. Candidates should ignore communications purporting to be from Atlas HXM that originate from any other email address. Atlas HXM will never ask candidates or employees to purchase gift cards or otherwise make payments in connection with applying for a job with Atlas HXM.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nscale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale is the GPU cloud engineered for AI. We provide cost-effective, high-performance infrastructure for AI start-ups and large enterprise customers. Nscale enables AI-focused companies to achieve superior results by reducing the complexity of AI development. Our GPU cloud bolsters technical capabilities and directly supports strategic business outcomes, including cost management, rapid innovation, and environmental responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you&#39;ll build trust through openness and transparency, where everyone is inspired to do their best work. If you join our team, you&#39;ll be contributing to building the technology that powers the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Director of Technical Program Management – Networking to build and lead the team of Technical Program Managers who deliver Nscale&#39;s network infrastructure across Europe. This team sits within our Deployment organisation, a build org that owns every step from hardware arrival on site through to customer acceptance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the delivery of cluster networking, data centre networking, and WAN programmes across our European sites, leading TPMs who partner with Network Engineering, Data Centre Operations, Supply Chain, and external carriers and vendors. This is a hands-on leadership role for someone who has delivered networks at hyperscale and knows how to turn complex, multi-site builds into predictable, repeatable execution. The role involves regular travel to our sites and partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and mentor a team of Technical Program Managers covering cluster networking, data centre networking, and WAN delivery across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end network delivery plan for new GPU cluster builds and expansions, from hardware arrival through installation, validation, and customer acceptance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the operating model for network programme delivery: planning standards, milestone gates, risk and dependency management, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Network Engineering on design readiness, BOMs, and build sequencing for Ethernet and InfiniBand fabrics, front-end networks, and WAN interconnects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across Deployment, Data Centre Operations, Supply Chain, Procurement, SRE, and Commercial teams so network delivery never blocks customer handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage strategic relationships with carriers, IXPs, colocation providers, and network hardware vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish metrics for delivery speed, quality, and predictability, and use them to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate status, risks, and trade-offs clearly to executive leadership and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire top TPM talent in a highly competitive market and grow a high-performing, accountable team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in technical programme management, network engineering, or infrastructure delivery, including 5+ years leading TPM or engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record delivering large-scale network infrastructure at a hyperscaler or major network vendor (e.g. Microsoft, AWS, Oracle/OCI, Cisco, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical grounding in cluster and data centre networking, WAN, and routing (BGP, EVPN/VXLAN, Ethernet and InfiniBand fabrics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running multi-site, multi-country builds with complex hardware, vendor, and carrier dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build programme management frameworks that scale with a fast-growing organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication and stakeholder management skills; comfortable influencing without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly across Europe to sites and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering networking for large GPU clusters or AI training environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HPC network topologies (Fat Tree, Rail) and high-speed optics (400G/800G).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with network automation and infrastructure-as-code in a deployment context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PgMP, or similar certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every GPU we deploy is only as useful as the network that connects it. This role sets how quickly and reliably Nscale turns hardware into capacity our customers can use, and shapes how network delivery scales as we expand across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, we are committed to fostering an inclusive, diverse, and equitable workplace. We believe that a variety of perspectives enriches our work environment, and we encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds, experiences, and abilities. We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will be responsible for executing high-quality designs for our financial products, ensuring they are intuitive, accessible, and effective. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams, mentor junior designers, and champion user-centred design within the organisation. This role requires a strategic mindset, deep UX/UI expertise, and the ability to translate complex financial concepts into seamless user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute design strategies that align with business objectives and user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end design process, from discovery and research to wireframing, prototyping, and final UI execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct advanced user research, usability testing, and A/B experiments to validate and refine design solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product managers and engineers to ensure seamless implementation of designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable UI components and contribute to our evolving design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for accessibility (A11y) and inclusive design principles, ensuring our products serve a diverse user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and refine micro-interactions and motion elements to improve user engagement and usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insights to continuously improve the user experience and optimise for business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide junior designers, fostering a culture of excellence and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of fintech trends and best practices to drive product innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a senior product design role, with a strong focus on UX and a demonstrated ability to lead impactful projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of visual design, typography, grids, layout, and colour theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in interaction design, information architecture, and user flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of designing for both mobile and web platforms, ensuring responsive and adaptive experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of behavioural psychology and how it influences user decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience conducting usability testing, user interviews, and heuristic evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesise qualitative and quantitative insights into impactful design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UX analytics tools (Google Analytics, Mixpanel, Hotjar, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in atomic design principles and building scalable UI frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of motion design tools (Lottie, After Effects, Principle) to create dynamic user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and guiding junior designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to articulate design rationale and influence stakeholders across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in agile, fast-paced product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figma mastery - deep experience with auto layout, design tokens, component variants, interactive prototypes, and scalable design libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in fintech and/or SaaS environments, with a strong understanding of industry challenges and user behaviours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership role in shaping the future of fintech - your work will impact millions of users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture of experimentation - we encourage innovative thinking and rapid iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-friendly work culture, with access to learning resources.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application &amp;amp; portfolio review: we look for strong UX case studies that showcase process, research, impact, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preliminary phone call with the recruiter: a brief conversation to discuss your background, interests, and expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with a design team member: a discussion about your experience, approach to design, alignment with our mission, and a portfolio walkthrough.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Challenge: an advanced exercise to assess problem-solving, UX/UI craft, and strategic thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final executive conversation: a discussion with senior leadership about your ability to think strategically, collaborate across teams, and drive business and user impact through design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Submit your resume and portfolio showcasing your best work - preferably with fintech or SaaS-related projects. Your portfolio should clearly demonstrate impact, including measurable improvements in user experience, business metrics, or engagement. We want to see end-to-end product thinking, including research, wireframes, prototypes, and final execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;The role:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Infrastructure Manager&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Milton Keynes - Hybrid 2 days per week&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Head of IT Service and Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;We are seeking a hands-on and experienced Infrastructure Engineering Manager to join our growing IT team. This role is central to the evolution and operational performance of our infrastructure estate, ensuring it remains secure, resilient, scalable, and aligned to business needs.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll play a key role in shaping and delivering infrastructure strategy across cloud, core enterprise platforms, connectivity, and end-user environments, with a strong focus on technical direction, platform improvement, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who is comfortable providing technical leadership, supporting delivery teams, leading operational improvements, and engaging with senior stakeholders across both technology and the wider business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;As part of a multi-skilled technology function, you will work closely with Product Managers and Delivery Managers to shape priorities, support OKRs, and ensure successful delivery of both strategic change and BAU activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1364&quot;&gt;This is a key role with significant influence on the future direction of our technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt; ·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1400&quot; data-end=&quot;1719&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1400&quot; data-end=&quot;1442&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on technical leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the ongoing development, standardisation, and modernisation of our corporate infrastructure estate across cloud and enterprise platforms. Contribute to solution design, problem solving, automation, platform improvement, and the resolution of complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1755&quot;&gt;Cloud and platform management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the effective adoption and operation of our cloud platforms and related infrastructure services, ensuring solutions are robust, well-governed, and operationally sustainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;Own operational performance and BAU delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure the effective day-to-day operation of infrastructure services, including monitoring, patching, lifecycle management, incident response, continuity, and continual service improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2402&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2216&quot;&gt;Drive delivery and prioritisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers and Delivery Managers to shape OKRs, prioritise work, and deliver infrastructure change, projects, and service improvements alongside BAU commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2404&quot; data-end=&quot;2639&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2404&quot; data-end=&quot;2447&quot;&gt;Stakeholder engagement and translation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships across technology and the business, translating technical issues, risks, and opportunities into clear, practical language for non-technical and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2641&quot; data-end=&quot;2840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2641&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;Improve engineering practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the development of standards, automation, and modern ways of working to improve consistency, efficiency, and quality across the infrastructure estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2886&quot; data-end=&quot;2998&quot;&gt;Significant experience in IT infrastructure, spanning cloud, networking, and modern secure access technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3000&quot; data-end=&quot;3134&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in Microsoft Azure, including infrastructure services, networking, identity, governance, and operational management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3136&quot; data-end=&quot;3258&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with automation and infrastructure-as-code tooling such as Terraform, Ansible, and PowerShell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3260&quot; data-end=&quot;3411&quot;&gt;Experience working in or supporting high-performing infrastructure teams, contributing to technical direction and delivery in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3413&quot; data-end=&quot;3540&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of infrastructure security, hardening, monitoring, resilience, compliance, and operational best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3542&quot; data-end=&quot;3657&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to communicate effectively with stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3659&quot; data-end=&quot;3798&quot;&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to take ownership of complex infrastructure challenges from design through to resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3800&quot; data-end=&quot;3899&quot;&gt;The ability to adapt to a rapidly changing environment and manage multiple priorities effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of hands-on infrastructure engineering and technical leadership in complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of both cloud and enterprise infrastructure, including servers, networking, identity, storage, and modern device management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience of infrastructure modernisation, particularly in Microsoft Azure-led environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience balancing strategic change, operational improvement, and BAU service ownership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of IT security practices and experience working alongside security teams to ensure infrastructure is resilient and compliant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead across a broad technology remit, operating effectively in Agile ways of working while remaining delivery-focused and outcome-driven&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to translate between technical and non-technical stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style, with the ability to develop people, build trust, and drive high standards across the team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on approach to infrastructure engineering, with an emphasis on operational efficiency and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 182);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rightmove, we believe software and product are ultimately people problems, and everything we build aims to improve the lives of others. We see AI as a helpful way to create more space for the human side of our work, from understanding real needs to making sure we are solving the right problems in the right way. There is an expectation that you are proactive in exploring how AI can support your own workflow and productivity, and that you approach it with curiosity and an open mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, Rightmove will never discriminate based on age, disability, sex, race, religion or belief, gender reassignment, marriage / civil partnership, pregnancy/maternity or sexual orientation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Rightmove, we believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce leads to better innovation, productivity, and overall success. We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of their background or identity, to develop and promote a diverse culture that reflects the communities we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;By applying, you confirm that you are aged at least 18 or over and&amp;nbsp;that you’ve read and understood our &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/c/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how we handle and protect your personal information during the recruitment process.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-3-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler,&amp;nbsp;by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions&amp;nbsp;of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Location: London (Hybrid)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting to: Group Engineering Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Head of Architecture at Rightmove, you&#39;ll shape our technology strategy and help turn our mission, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&quot;to give everyone the belief they can make their move&quot;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; into a well-designed, scalable technology estate. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll guide how we evolve a broad set of systems, from in-house software to third-party solutions, within a modern, containerised, event-driven architecture. You will be at the forefront of&amp;nbsp;Rightmove’s journey&amp;nbsp;into AI as it transforms not just the software we build but the way we build&amp;nbsp;it. It&#39;s a chance to influence the technical direction of the UK&#39;s leading property portal, with real impact on millions of home movers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Key &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In your first year, you&#39;ll focus on:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Setting architecture strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - Build and drive a company-wide architecture strategy that supports our broader business goals.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enabling engineering teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;Work closely&amp;nbsp;with the&amp;nbsp;software engineering community so the strategy is understood and&amp;nbsp;all 40+ teams&amp;nbsp;can make good architectural decisions quickly, without unnecessary process or delay.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leading the architecture team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;Manage and develop a team of seven architects who influence and advise on design across the organisation.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partnering with data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;Support the data and analytics department&amp;nbsp;so our data platform architecture aligns with the wider platform architecture.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ongoing responsibilities also include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Overseeing a varied technology landscape of in-house software and third-party applications to create a cohesive ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with technology and product leaders to connect architecture decisions to business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Influencing TCO by aligning architectural decisions with business outcomes in the most efficient and cost-effective way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience leading architecture at scale (team or organisation size can vary; we care about the complexity and impact of what you&#39;ve led)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A solid grasp of&amp;nbsp;modern distributed architectures; containerisation, event-driven systems, and the trade-offs between availability and consistency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to set clear architectural direction across a high-traffic, high-change environment as it adjusts to an AI-enabled future. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing an architecture or engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with a track record of working across engineering, product, and senior leadership to align technical and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building inclusive, collaborative engineering cultures through mentoring, team design and influence.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An understanding of how to drive architectural change in a DevOps environment that makes over a thousand production changes a month. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in property, marketplaces, e-commerce, or other high-traffic consumer platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
